!!! oculus/window-geometry.mat
!!! Foundational geometry types for the Oculus semantic model.
!!!
!!! Defines point and rectangle — kept together because records
!!! reference each other and must be in the same compilation unit.

book oculus.window.geometry

read everything from ny.lang.core

!!! A position in 2D coordinate space.

public point begin record
    field x as override long
    field y as override long
end record

!!! An axis-aligned rectangle defined by origin and size.

public rectangle begin record
    field origin as point
    field width as override long
    field height as override long
end record
